.TH AGTMLS 1 "2026-11-17" "agtmls 0.0.35" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agtmls \- verified registry and installer for AI-agent skills
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agtmls
[\fB\-\-version\fR]
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBagtmls\fR validates, indexes, audits, exports and installs agent skills,
prompts, commands and subagents. Each skill is content-addressed, the index is
signed, and an install is recorded in a lockfile that \fBverify\fR checks.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBdoctor\fR [\-h] [\-\-target TARGET] [\-\-agent {aider,antigravity,claude,codex}] [\-\-skills\-only] [\-\-bundle BUNDLE] [\-\-installed]
health checks for a checkout, or with \-\-installed the installed registry and a target.
.TP
\fBstatus\fR [\-h] [\-\-target TARGET] [\-\-agent {aider,antigravity,claude,codex}] [\-\-skills\-only] [\-\-bundle BUNDLE] [\-\-installed]
the same checks as doctor.
.TP
\fBcheck\fR [\-h]
run every check in checks.json, the gate CI runs.
.TP
\fBlist\fR [\-h] [\-\-bundle BUNDLE] [\-\-json] [{skills,commands}]
list the registry's skills, or its commands.
.TP
\fBsearch\fR [\-h] [\-\-json] query
find skills and commands whose name, description, bundle, path or tags hold every term.
.TP
\fBshow\fR [\-h] [\-\-json] name
print one skill's or command's index entry.
.TP
\fBstats\fR [\-h] [\-\-json]
summarise the registry: counts, bundles, coverage and quality.
.TP
\fBprofiles\fR [\-h] [\-\-json]
list the install profiles in profiles.json.
.TP
\fBproviders\fR [\-h] [\-\-json]
list the native agents and export targets in providers.json.
.TP
\fBexport\fR [\-h] [\-\-provider PROVIDER] [\-\-profile PROFILE] [\-\-bundle BUNDLE] [\-\-out\-dir OUT_DIR]
export a provider\-neutral bundle of the registry for one provider.
.TP
\fBdocs-site\fR [\-h] [\-\-write] [\-\-check]
generate the static HTML catalog in site/, or check it is current.
.TP
\fBrelease-pack\fR [\-h] [\-\-out\-dir OUT_DIR] [\-\-profile PROFILE] [\-\-provider PROVIDER]
build release artifacts and their checksums.
.TP
\fBnext-version\fR [\-h] [\-\-tag] [\-\-json]
print the next allowed release version.
.TP
\fBbump-version\fR [\-h] [\-\-version VERSION] [\-\-date DATE] [\-\-check]
move every version carrier to the next allowed version.
.TP
\fBrelease-dry-run\fR [\-h] [\-\-version VERSION] [\-\-skip\-check] [\-\-profile PROFILE] [\-\-provider PROVIDER]
rehearse a release without tagging or publishing.
.TP
\fBverify-release-assets\fR [\-h] [\-\-tag TAG] [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-out\-dir OUT_DIR]
download a GitHub release and verify its checksums and tarball manifests.
.TP
\fBevolve\fR [\-h] \-\-skill\-name SKILL_NAME transcript
turn a session transcript into a redacted skill\-evolution proposal.
.TP
\fBevidence\fR [\-h] \-\-skill SKILL [\-\-command EVIDENCE_COMMANDS] [\-\-file FILE] [\-\-outcome OUTCOME]
record a local skill invocation evidence event.
.TP
\fBmcp-resources\fR [\-h] [\-\-write] [\-\-check]
generate the MCP resource descriptors for the skills, or check them.
.TP
\fBplugin-manifests\fR [\-h] [\-\-write] [\-\-check]
generate every runtime's plugin manifest, or check them.
.TP
\fBsbom\fR [\-h] [\-\-write] [\-\-check]
generate the SPDX 2.3 and CycloneDX 1.6 SBOMs, or check them.
.TP
\fBprovenance\fR [\-h] [\-\-write] [\-\-check]
generate the in\-toto SLSA provenance statement, or check it.
.TP
\fBprovider-install\fR [\-h] \-\-provider PROVIDER \-\-target TARGET [\-\-profile PROFILE] [\-\-check]
install a provider's adapter files into a target directory.
.TP
\fBbench\fR [\-h]
measure how long AgtMLS takes, and fail when it gets slower.
.TP
\fBdiff\fR [\-h] \-\-from OLD [\-\-to NEW] [\-\-json]
diff two index files.
.TP
\fBrelease-check\fR [\-h]
run the release\-focused checks.
.TP
\fBaudit\fR [\-h] [\-\-all] [\-\-foreign PATH|GIT\-URL@SHA] [\-\-strict] [\-\-pedantic] [\-\-json] [\-\-format {text,json,sarif}] [\-\-baseline BASELINE] [\-\-write\-baseline WRITE_BASELINE] [\-\-changed\-agent\-config BASE] [path]
statically audit skills for prompt injection, steganography, and security risks.
.TP
\fBimport-skill\fR [\-h] [\-\-name NAME] [\-\-bundle BUNDLE] source
import an external Markdown skill into the draft area.
.TP
\fBindex\fR [\-h] [\-\-write] [\-\-check]
generate index.json, or check it is current.
.TP
\fBoptimize\fR [\-h] [\-\-check] [\-\-write] [file]
report filler and volatile lines in an always\-loaded markdown file.
.TP
\fBpack\fR [\-h] [\-\-max\-tokens MAX_TOKENS] [\-\-allow\-partial] [\-\-output OUTPUT] [skills ...]
pack skills and context into a token\-bounded Repomix XML block.
.TP
\fBinstall\fR [\-h] [\-\-target TARGET] [\-\-allow\-home] [\-\-skills\-only] [\-\-copy] [\-\-bundle BUNDLE] [\-\-profile PROFILE] [\-\-force] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-no\-verify] language {aider,antigravity,claude,codex}
install the skills, commands and prompt file for one agent into a repository.
.TP
\fBverify\fR [\-h] [\-\-target TARGET] [\-\-signatures] [\-\-live] [\-\-json] {aider,antigravity,claude,codex}
check an installed tree against its .agtmls/manifest.json lockfile.
.TP
\fBuninstall\fR [\-h] [\-\-target TARGET] [\-\-remove\-prompt] {aider,antigravity,claude,codex}
remove what install put into a repository.
.TP
\fBpropose-skill\fR [\-h] \-\-skill\-name SKILL_NAME transcript
turn a session transcript into a redacted skill proposal.
.TP
\fBscaffold-skill\fR [\-h] [\-\-bundle BUNDLE] [\-\-title TITLE] name
scaffold a new skill from the templates.
